<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23248" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαΐς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαΐδος,</span>
		
			Att.
		
		
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾴς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾳδός, ἡ</span>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίω
			Α</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fire-brand, pinetorch,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαΐδων ὑπὸ λαμπομενάων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.492
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαΐδας μετὰ χερσὶν ἔχοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.101
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾷδες,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπάδες</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Philyll.
				29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀραμένη δαΐδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(5).229.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαχεν μυστιπόλους <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ</span>,</span> of a <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾳδοῦχος,</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.172
			</span></i>: in sg., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1494
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				199
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				272
			</span></i>: collective in sg., metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ
				τὴν δᾷδα προελθεῖν</span> to come to the
				<i>funeral-torch.</i> i.e. end of life, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.789a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as collective
			noun, <i>pine-wood,</i> such as torches were made of, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				57.32
			</span></i> (Milet., V B.C.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				612
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.5.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Col.</u>
				791b24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				1.329.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>a disease in pines, resin-glut,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.9.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαδίον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, Hp <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.133
			</span></i>.</div>
